error[E3316]  a/a.canon:9:20
  a wire name of a holds U+0000 (NUL): generated C++ readers compare names as C strings and would cut it; write another character

error[E3316]  a/a.canon:10:26
  a wire name of b holds U+0000 (NUL): generated C++ readers compare names as C strings and would cut it; write another character

error[E3316]  a/a.canon:11:35
  a wire name of c holds U+0000 (NUL): generated C++ readers compare names as C strings and would cut it; write another character

